WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.634
[music playing]

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.970
NARRATOR: The snows
of winter evaporate

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.205
into the mists of spring.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:13.046
And the shadowy bobcat emerges
with an apprentice killer

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:13.847
in tow.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:21.588
Mother is an old hand at this.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.124
The kitten mirrors
her every move.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.863
The huntress demonstrates
the finer points.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:49.449
Watch for the tiniest tremor,
listen for the slightest

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:54.287
screeching, and pounce.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.597
[screeching]

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:08.635
That the voles sometimes get
away is part of the education.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.844
If at first you don't
succeed, try, try again.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.928
Mom's kill leads to a
rousing game of keep-away.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:45.305
This sharpens the
youngster's ability to chase.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.740
And while her kitten
eats, perhaps mom

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:48.842
will find her own lunch.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.688
But no, there is another
kitten waiting in the wings.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:08.361
[music playing]

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.431
And the merry-go-round
starts all over again.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:37.657
Kids-- sometimes it seems
like they'll never leave home.

